   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"cluster-overview\">\n<p class=\"lead\">Die Runtime Environment (RTE) realisiert den Virtual Functional Bus (VFB) auf einer konkreten ECU und vermittelt alle Inter- und Intra-ECU-Kommunikationsverbindungen zwischen Software-Components (SW-Cs) und Basis-Software.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"sect\">Module im Cluster</h2>\n<div class=\"cards\">\n  <a class=\"card\" href=\"modules/rte.html\">\n    <h3>AUTOSAR RTE</h3>\n    <p>The RTE realizes the Virtual Functional Bus (VFB) on a specific ECU, providing communication between Software Components and basic software.</p>\n    <div class=\"card-meta\">\n      <span class=\"chip\">BSW ID 2</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\">13 APIs (10 Funktionen, 3 Typen)</span>\n      <span class=\"chip\"><code>#include &quot;Rte.h&quot;</code></span>\n    </div>\n  </a>\n</div>",
